title: text "Zoom 2: the data plane, two tiers chosen per edge" at 40,52 style=h1
text "How bytes actually move between a source and DuckDB (sinks mirror it, further down)." at 40,80 style=dek

// ---- the planner question, per edge, per run ----
text "per edge, per run, the planner asks:" at 904,124 style=caption weight=600
d1: decision "max_rows_per_second\ndeclared?" at 904,136 240x96
d2: decision "TryGetNativeScan()\nreturns a scan?" at 432,136 240x96
d1 -> d2 "no: check native scan" label.caps=0
d2.left -> tier1.top@200 "yes: fast path" label.caps=0
d2.bottom -> tier2.top@800 "no: universal path" label.caps=0
d1.bottom -> tier2.top@1024
text "yes: universal path (skips TryGetNativeScan)." at 1040,256 style=caption
text "Pacing needs the batch loop, so a" at 1040,272 style=caption
text "native-only connector is refused." at 1040,288 style=caption

// ---- tier 1 ----
tier1: zone "Tier 1: native scan / copy (fast path)" at 40,304 632x496 title.align=left
az_src: external "az://analytics/clicks/*.parquet" at 64,344 268x56
readers: focal "DuckDB parallel readers" sub="+ predicate pushdown" at 384,344 264x56
az_src -> readers
text "bytes go straight from storage into DuckDB:" at 64,428 style=caption
text ".NET never sees them" at 64,444 style=caption
text "transient failures (HTTP 5xx / timeouts)" at 384,428 style=caption color=muted
text "are classified for retry + breaker" at 384,444 style=caption color=muted
text "what the connector hands the engine (NativeScan record)" at 64,480 style=caption weight=600
rect at 64,488 584x96 radius=6 fill=ink/0.04 stroke=ink/0.12
text "SetupStatements: CREATE SECRET src_az (TYPE azure, CONNECTION_STRING '…');" at 76,508 style=small
text "SqlFragment:" at 76,524 style=small
text "-- never logged" at 362,524 style=small
text "CREATE TABLE staging.src_events__clicks AS" at 87,540 style=small
text "SELECT * FROM read_parquet('az://analytics/clicks/*.parquet');" at 87,556 style=small
text "Mechanism: \"read_parquet\"" at 76,572 style=small
text "-- shows up in pz plan reasons" at 222,572 style=small
text "The connector's whole job collapses to config translation: YAML connection block in," at 64,620 style=caption
text "scan SQL + secret setup out. DuckDB's own readers (parquet, csv, azure, ...) do the moving." at 64,636 style=caption
text "and pz plan tells you which tier won, and why:" at 64,676 style=caption weight=600
rect at 64,684 584x80 radius=6 fill=ink/0.04 stroke=ink/0.12
text "$ pz plan" at 76,704 style=small
